<title>USA: Avon names Woodbury executive v-p.</title>
<headline>Avon names Woodbury executive v-p.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avon Products Inc said Wednesday it had named Edwina Woodbury executive vice president, chief financial and administrative officer.</p>
<p>Woodbury previously was senior vice president, chief financial and administrative officer.</p>
<p>She has also been assigned expanded responsibilities for the company's global information technology services group.</p>
</text>
